      "before": "<h1>关卡02 首次进入大厅</h1><h1><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/4663ce8e3f4018ed0bd96ec8fd6e519761ad58359d4e912645897d0cf80e7a34.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">前往大厅<br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/96751f8760cbeae00a7ee2274db844d01bbaff232f02a0b405a32a99b2ae8b7a.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">电箱谜题：每个引脚颜色对应一次加减，合计为+12即可解锁音频【拼图】</div></div></div><div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/68ce51dcb71239baad3b2848d7c4c56906a987759630e0e6c25160a1544157a8.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">【视界探测器】音频听取到Igor</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/62e80a604ff6be00fc8e5321563c82b0ca41b5a3a339a681c669e4aee18d3f7e.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">在黄圈内播放【拼图】音频，听取到Petrov</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/b388202cd79e4009ee5e04aa6529aff0a144672fd7c246fa83fe47e9453e05f8.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">大厅电脑：Igor Petrov</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/dd756f59b35b18918b363bf0f2c48c8b9724a8e3432eaf86aa7a980c2a6d77ba.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">更新K9，升级无接触门禁系统（解锁储物柜、连接器等）</div></div></div></div></div></h1><h3><span>依次前往舱段打开AMAAN储物柜（获取今年生日日期）、厨房冰箱蛋糕蜡烛（获取年龄）、AMAAN房间（打开