.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">解锁车库二楼电脑，获取量子电池容器密码<br></div></div></div></div></div></div></h1><h2><b>首次前往连接器的实验室（左岔路）</b></h2><h1><div><div><div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/843003fc9b7e83bffe0eb4aba5550dc2d9f4b3b07a05c032e715564f2de9602f.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">实验室密码提示：AION属于什么纲（之后获取）</div></div></div></div></h1><h2>首次前往连接器的观测站（右岔路）</h2><h1><div><div></div><div><img src=\"assets/837b8487108e64cb6c0a7feaf4516dcc1d50ebd319de456755071e64ad70c76d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/dd1cf32b9bfd62dd73230901ca0889125341b8d33d1d8360a1f297b6ba19c854.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">Planta中心密码，AMAAN的可托（德）西林药物处方<br></div></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/c22991803ff55a27ad63398aa2684f10d1a7dd3e3526c2b9d06daed7d58c6f43.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3f374eccd9c31cddd2dc0094a0c0673594b354bf6c43865bc688ef32d032337a.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><img src=\"assets/3e6e930645e0aee417e8d2d5345a8c98c4180303f42bf3e5112596cf84e3f38c.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/6a2751ad2c3fb350357f3a7b10b3ec9374f48f5e7228493dddef032360357f10.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px