494ed5ebae69ab01941c4ab9be16ad5a98d99223eee8f.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">插入量子电池，验证指纹</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/ef6b76c05e6c10412a884aa24f02162ac52e9b538ac23b278e09606c2b2354a5.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">谜题随机，连接电路，使得电源达到+2</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/5066c47a54091c154b7a0922d7a2c0b51524f06e2afc4d114f635a9d49280245.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">获取关卡03门禁卡信息，打印方法（在MIRANDA储物柜拿钥匙，培育区箱子破碎门禁卡，去打印）</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/c3e003a0b6e0d21ada9014b88e6ea34319b914930251b11319d23cbe4a7cf05d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">关卡03门禁卡</div></div></div></div></div></div></h1>",
      "after": "<h1>关卡02 首次进入大厅</h1><h1><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/6b71a3231cbad52d7a6f2e01660102e880f98bfd453f3843546fcfb43c76ea02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">前往大厅<br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/134397e853b5e695278a737f2bc0f4cfe8d3676d98d4fcd61c5391c8818a18e7.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">电箱谜题：每个引脚颜色对应一次加减，合计为+12即可解锁音频【拼图】</div></div></div><div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/ae33aed74ddb070251ecb8118b7f158ae136a69d6853ee09c83f6cd5b5a9555b.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">【视界探测器】音频听取到Igor</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/af705a87b6bd6f29954875b89a2e91dce1b2952609c6a9b1d55cdd519045af5c.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">在黄圈内播放【拼图】音频，听取到Petrov</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/053e067774f499d1119ce1cd6cfaaaa2da1b0f739181344de44d337481339e41.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">大厅电脑：Igor Petrov</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/0898296c62c0c8ba28885f436a50ee764a7c054bd09a001aa50bd65a1725b217.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">更新K9，升级无接触门禁系统（解锁储物柜、连接器等）</div></div></div></div></div></h1><h3><span>依次前往舱段打开AMAAN储物柜（获取今年生日日期）、厨房冰箱蛋糕蜡烛（获取年龄）、AMAAN房间（打开AMAAN保险库）</span></h3><h1><div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/42aca606a1167bb8f898c3d7dfc569846f0a056466324118e6ab63356ca93ca5.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">今年生日日期：25/08/2466</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/76635438e00073b53b041d0eb2b4a33886e4a1edfc96f84da814ad5a459f329c.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">60岁生日</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3bcbafdf7c5349d3bf85558b0476773feeff125f2925a65bc07b2ffa96415ea9.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">AMAAN生日：25/08/2406</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/8f449892cb4ec08fb63bc39f46dd5d4092e5b3ccdcc7f2dfb3550e2ac2933b13.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">AMAAN保险库饮料：COSMIK!</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/4d0e18d4aeeed44bd0283d53e690dfb3b1b523802d1af0d13c13e279f37af2e2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><div><span>根据AMAAN卧室3张语法说明，依次输入</span></div><div>LS</div><div>BUILD HYPERVIOLET.QB</div><div>COPY FLASHLIGHT.EXE MIRANDA.V<br></div><div>获取紫外光</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/c08d93de6e6c0f52dc29d74a2e299a03b630099d16f4780ced35ad08d394bd44.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">紫外照射</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/90bf95046ae2cbfbf24cb232f7dda33bf402af5e84165b228fe067e03207f1b1.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">AMAAN保险库</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/79eda8d9c60c20c9b9949668e1c6e22dab898f0e3e232c782792d2490e4bf1ae.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">厨房零食贩卖机</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/623d35f3441eb6dd8678f6a93031dabb8081972944e7f6dca23502f70a2cfb38.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">AMAAN房间白板，紫外照射<br></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/85092495d2b9b301c857f4885c5ace52fdd6bc35f5e8234affb9bbf8367ff319.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3d16fa6a429d906a90f7c99aeb11d6f9c478bdee15f709d94f3c99805d07f8c4.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">从自动贩卖机获取【多重通行权】门禁卡</div></div></div></div></div></div></h1><h2>首次进入车库</h2><h1><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/5afe1c40076506726670e5f4530893d195197e1f789c72aa5a6eb93f0648254a.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/1e7ee4994d409d846087a6895093316ea948564afb9f077d1a107b6c5cb87b90.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">1楼3个，2楼1个，全部插入船体并关闭，上2楼</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/b061177854eac74b62ec9be371e367d0c416dfd77ff6a05c6f602d2ea7e30072.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><div><span style=\"text-align: center\"><b>1.</b>ARES—SCRP-01—SCRP-02—AST-AR1—SDT-11—X-248—LUX-8—BTH-12—DATA-04</span><br></div><div><span style=\"text-align: center\"><b>2.</b>DATA-04—NNS-7—RE-005—VAN-26—ARK-18—X-303—Y-1KFT—Z-4MK—TIE-1—DATA-01</span><span style=\"text-align: center\"><br></span></div><div><span><b>3.</b>DATA-01—ORB-2—OA-9—AQ-94—GW-11—AW-13—SHFT-1—DATA-06—ATV-3—SA-X—MVL-30—ORE-X—VR-M—DATA-03</span><span style=\"text-align: center\"><br></span></div><div><span><b>4.</b>DATA-03—12B-0—P88-1—SPKT—ESA-6—DATA-02—CXO-X—11K-68—XM-R—EK-TE—ZX-2A—DATA-05</span><span><br></span></div><div><span><b>5.</b>DATA-05—SAS-11—EOS—MER-A—AUOS—RD-004—ARES</span></div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/4cd018c2b9be135a5fe70da1a9a649d5705d73f12617de4e088a367ecb933bd9.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/d96f2c77f654ec7987a3bd0e3e79c9c612897f8eb051eb14c05303d8ab2a28a5.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>车库1楼电脑桌右侧，拿着【输入板】到大厅的视界探测器，根据粒子波音频，</span></div><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>在输入板上还原出6位数字顺序（随机），顺序播放音频给视界探测器</span><br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/94af42447466430328b27e67ce76684bc531ea8cc0b35f4416356b2d9f48748e.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">完成后，获取车库二楼电脑的EXNILON方案，前往使用</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/e56eff893db952944862cdf2151f794010b7f432bfc80c4d0e3e04b835a3fea9.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">解锁车库二楼电脑，获取量子电池容器密码<br></div></div></div></div></div></div></h1><h2><b>首次前往连接器的实验室（左岔路）</b></h2><h1><div><div><div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/fbf6632b3a9c909978a214c7271f02637a3862ad39eb49c8e0ae363d4d734d1a.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">实验室密码提示：AION属于什么纲（之后获取）</div></div></div></div></h1><h2>首次前往连接器的观测站（右岔路）</h2><h1><div><div></div><div><img src=\"assets/40d990210882d0860dc8358c0bb9e60752f8251b7bd07a87e983b02354410bc4.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/f1150c187dd8461014aced165c14462a73ed452a223ed14e77fdd239c702272c.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">Planta中心密码，AMAAN的可托（德）西林药物处方<br></div></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/0371bccabe592a0d5b43df9ebdce3b575bc4527b21d5f9a57c5826e4975c719f.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/54e34c613fd94725b6fa24328abfcb6a4095870e8502a8dac7e074d725d7d2c4.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><img src=\"assets/28d398a2fdba7452822b8467cc291c79ebb19e0a669f57564abf19d7cd36d38f.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/3645c9dbb8e0814c29a39aa652956ccff92920ed0b3bfbbc8616e8f2acebd0fc.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;