azy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div></div></h1><h2>集齐4个JK指纹</h2><h1><div><div></div><div><img src=\"assets/54ea408b68ff35703506266e649b364756047a9e0817130c81ef859d37e29564.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/8206a15ccb60bdd8010ca9165d90bbfa4db4608b48a14ed041eb4f82eaa53f12.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/b9c2ce68d673877d38595af74245eeb9bcc8e1309682e971cbe8cba6cddf944a.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/fa504212f66f9343a5c604a11d54da9ef83a674787f9429104e647bbac52d55f.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/2605da7a0973d5357fb6393f2a7186d87b0df72bdac7eee2ff0466e659cdbaaf.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/89762c78da4f8a0f087d330d9606648d0ef19cfb40439c35fb81c80f6eb9d2e1.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/c38a61c43f1b0705744123f9b369c7f87a2b9f9c100e707245d34cf3eca8752d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/14c6f8d876a8fe5c8f2da90372e1570f6f0ddc320eedda86f780d05ddc67e631.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">集齐JK指纹，用于观测站解锁太阳能板</div></div></div></div></h1><h2>新一循环，不要使用量子电池，直奔连接器——<span style=\"text-align: center\">观测站</span></h2><h1><div><div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/353003219dabf7454cff